event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nMan, I’m so sorry"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". I know how heavy this has been weighing on you lately, and it sucks that it hasn't improved. \n\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"If staying is actively wrecking your mental health, walking away might genuinely be the right call. But before you pull the trigger tomorrow, do"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" you have a plan or a bit of a financial buffer to land on? \n\nLet’s get on a call tonight or grab dinner—"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"my treat. Talk it through with me first. If quitting tomorrow still makes the most sense after we look at the logistics"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", I'll back you 100%, but let’s make sure you’re making a clean break"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" rather than just reacting to a terrible day.\n\n## 2\n\nI'm genuinely curious: if every photo and video from space is"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" faked, how do you account for the sheer scale of people who would have to be lying? \n\nWe’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"re talking hundreds of thousands of independent scientists, amateur astronomers tracking satellites from their own backyards, commercial pilots, and rival"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" space agencies across competing nations—like the US, China, and Russia—who agree on almost nothing geopolitically, yet somehow"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" coordinate the exact same secret without a single leak.\n\nBeyond photos, though, how do you explain everyday observations? Things"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" like ships dipping hull-first over the horizon, the fact that you see completely different constellations in the Southern Hemisphere than in the Northern Hemisphere"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", or the circular shadow the Earth casts on the Moon during a lunar eclipse?\n\n## 3\n\nTo understand why the sky is blue,"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" you have to look at two things: what light is made of, and what’s floating in our air.\n\nLight"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" from the Sun looks white, but it’s actually a mix of every color in the rainbow combined. Light travels in"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" waves, and each color has a different wavelength: red and orange light travel in long, lazy waves, while blue and violet light travel in short"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", quick, choppy waves.\n\nOur atmosphere is packed with billions of tiny gas molecules, mostly nitrogen and oxygen. When"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" sunlight hits the atmosphere, the long red waves glide right past those tiny molecules without much trouble, like large ocean waves rolling past a pebble"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". But the short, choppy blue waves run straight into them and bounce off in every possible direction. \n\nScientists call this **"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Rayleigh scattering**. Because blue light gets bounced around the whole sky like a pinball, whenever you look up away from the direct Sun, your"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" eyes are catching that scattered blue light. \n\n(And if you’re wondering why the sky isn't violet"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", since violet waves are even shorter: the Sun emits far more blue light than violet, and our human eyes are much more sensitive"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" to blue!)\n\n## 4\n\n夜色渐浓，窗外细雨绵绵，在微凉的玻璃上汇成一道"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"道弯曲的水痕。街旁的路灯在湿漉漉的柏油路面上晕染出一圈圈昏"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"黄的光晕，偶尔有车辆疾驰而过，激起清脆的水花声，旋即又归于沉寂。"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"空气里弥漫着泥土与青草混合的潮润气息。室内只亮着一盏暖光"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"台灯，听着屋檐下节奏舒缓的滴答声，白日里的浮躁与喧嚣仿佛都被"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"这场夜雨悄然洗净，只余下一室的安宁与释然。\n\n## 5\n\nSubject: Re: Team"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" drinks this Friday\n\nHi [Name],\n\nThanks so much for organizing! \n\nUnfortunately, I have a prior commitment this"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" Friday evening, so I won't be able to make it. I hope you all have a great time, and I'"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ll definitely catch you at the next one.\n\nHave a great week!\n\nBest,  \n[Your Name]\n\n"}}

